WEBVTT

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:36.290
Hinohara...

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.160
Hey!

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.140
There are some things 
I want to ask you.

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:46.450
You seem to be his friend, 
so tell me about Hinohara.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:48.330
What'd you say?

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:50.830
Huh? You are his friend, right?

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:53.630
Arata!

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:57.450
Honestly, I take my eyes off you 
for a second, and you're gone.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:00.640
Come with me. We're going to 
say hello to your teacher.

00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:02.140
Sorry about this.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:02.990
Come on!

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:04.460
Hey, hang on, lady!

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:06.600
Don't call me "lady!" Call me Mom!

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:10.730
You have to say hello to 
your teacher. Understood?

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:14.940
You won't get away with 
screwing around like that.

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:17.180
Please look after him.

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:22.160
Homura

00:02:17.810 --> 00:02:19.900
His memory hasn't returned,

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.160
so I wanted to give him 
a little more time off,

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:25.240
but he insisted that he 
wanted to go to school.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:29.270
"Mom," huh?

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:36.150
Yo, Hinohara.

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.220
Come with us for a sec.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.430
We brought him, Kadowaki.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.800
I thought you had shut 
yourself up at home,

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:50.890
and now you're faking amnesia?

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:59.770
Whoa, what a great view!

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:02.990
The sun is there, so the Hinohara 
house would be over there!

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.900
What's with him?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:06.740
Hey!

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:08.550
Yeah? What's up?

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:13.360
Do you really think I'm...

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.000
Who do you think you are?!

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:18.150
I only came because I was asked to.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.010
I should be asking who 
you think <i>you</i> are.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:23.280
What's with that big shot attitude?

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:26.220
Hey, for a guy who 
wasn't gone very long,

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:28.090
you've learned to talk pretty tough.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:32.790
You guys aren't Hinohara's friends.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:34.530
Friends?

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:36.020
If you want friends, 
give us your money.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.460
Then we'll be your friends.

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:40.940
Idiotic.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:41.890
Hold it!

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:46.610
I don't deal with wimps 
who can't do anything

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:49.260
without a gang to back them up. Later.

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:49.790
What?!

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:52.790
Hinohara!

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.500
All right, you wanna play?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.920
Happy to oblige!

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:06.640
What, it's over already?

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:11.710
Kadowaki, I don't know 
what Arata did to you,

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:15.940
but he's putting his life 
on the line in my place.

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.570
I won't stand for you belittling him.

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.820
Are you okay, Kotoha?

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:31.000
I'm fine. I just took a little spill.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:36.630
Kanate!

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.700
You're such a klutz, Kotoha-chan.

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.580
You leave me no choice.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:44.170
Here. I'll carry you.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.330
I'm sorry, Master Arata.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:50.900
Let's rest a bit.

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:53.270
That's all right. I can walk.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:58.520
I'm sorry!

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.400
You can't keep going, Kotoha-chan.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:05.780
We should rest in that grove 
we just came through.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.270
You're right. Can you make it?

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:11.040
Thank you.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:14.460
Careful.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.210
Okay.

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:27.380
It's pretty swollen.

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:30.890
You're with the Uneme clan. 
Can't you heal it?

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:33.390
We can't heal ourselves.

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:36.450
Oh... That's kinda inconvenient.

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:39.400
I'll go look for medicinal herbs, then.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.220
I know one that works for pain.

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:42.950
I appreciate it, Kanate.

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:45.650
Thank you.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.910
All right! Leave it to me!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.470
I'm sorry this happened 
when we're in a hurry.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.550
It's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:05.290
Just let me stay like this.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:09.920
These are the only times 
I get to do this.

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:15.130
Even though you're right beside me,

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:19.000
sometimes it feels like 
you're so far away.

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:21.260
It makes me feel lonely.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:27.290
I am a girl, after all.

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.000
Just a normal girl.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.100
Master Arata...

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:43.130
I'm going to check the area.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:56.320
<i>That's right, it's not 
me she's thinking of.</i>

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:59.540
<i>It's him. It's Arata.</i>

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:10.950
Yo, Hinohara!

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:13.390
Arata...

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:19.580
I see. So Akachi took 
Kannagi's Hayagami.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:23.460
Sounds like things are 
getting dicey there.

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:24.740
Yeah.

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:27.670
You're a Sho now, too. Be careful.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.670
I know.

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:32.630
Are you sure you're okay?

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:33.840
Y-Yeah.

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:38.720
Oh, yeah! How's Kotoha doing?

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:44.320
This is an important time 
for Master Arata.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.580
How could I...

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:55.990
Arata...

00:07:57.090 --> 00:08:00.710
How do you feel about Kotoha?

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:04.490
Huh? Why do you ask 
that all of a sudden?

00:08:04.490 --> 00:08:07.710
Uh, no reason. Just curious.

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:13.510
Well, we've been together 
since we were babies,

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.320
so I've never really thought about it.

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:19.260
A little sister, I guess?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.750
I can't say she's like an older sister.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.480
Yeah, that's it.

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:26.940
If I had to say, 
I'd call her a little sister.

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.560
Really? A little sister?

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:36.120
Yeah. A precious little sister 
I have to protect, no matter what.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:40.500
Even though we're separated now, 
since all this happened.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.790
So I'm counting on you, Hinohara.

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:48.460
Protect Kotoha in my place.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:53.220
All right. I promise I will.

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:55.660
All right! I trust you!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.220
Yeah.

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:06.290
Let's see...

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:11.380
What's this all the way out here? 
Someone's grave?

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.670
Hey! The herbs!

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:17.210
Kotoha-chan's gonna be so happy!

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:20.130
She might even give 
me a thank you kiss!

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:28.890
What's going on?

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:30.880
Whoa, that's hot!

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.710
What the hell is happening?!

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:37.680
Oh, yeah. I should let you 
know what's going on here.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:40.220
I went to school.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:43.310
School?! Was that okay?!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.670
Yeah, it was fine.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.990
There was one annoying guy there, 
though, so I popped him one.

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:51.670
What? That's not okay at all!

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:53.980
It's fine, I tell ya!

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:58.660
Please, just behave.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.320
So, who was the guy?

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:03.080
Oh, his name was Kadowaki.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.330
He sure is weak, for all his big talk.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:11.730
Oh, he's not your friend 
or anything, right?

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:14.090
I saw a... What's it called? A photo?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.140
Hey, Hinohara?

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:25.400
What's wrong?

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:28.850
Okay, later, Hinohara! Good luck!

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:31.630
Give Kotoha my regards! Bye!

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:37.000
What's up with him?

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:44.860
Kadowaki...

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:48.380
You're wide open.

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:49.870
Kannagi!

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:53.020
How about you give me your Hayagami?

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:56.290
The sword of origins that 
will reign over the world...

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:58.040
Tsukuyo.

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:15.040
Kannagi... Is it really this easy?

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.140
Is this what I was after?

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.360
Give me your Hayagami!

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:23.730
Never!

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.250
Give it to me.

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:39.840
Did you...?

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:44.260
Sadly, without Homura, 
I no longer control the flames.

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:48.280
A lava flow runs along an 
underground vein in this area.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:52.480
Occasionally, it bursts through 
the surface like this.

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:55.680
The flames here devour people.

00:11:58.710 --> 00:11:59.530
How?

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:01.500
I've lost Homura,

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:06.920
but as long as the chosen ones 
exist in this world, I am a Sho.

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:11.210
In other words, flames 
are still my very being.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:17.840
Appear!

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:32.570
Why do you want this Hayagami?

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:34.780
I'm the one Tsukuyo chose!

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.690
Only until your life ends.

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:42.900
Hand it over, and I will 
kill you painlessly.

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:48.870
Even if I die, you don't know 
that Tsukuyo will choose you—

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:49.740
Quiet!

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:53.690
That Hayagami is the 
only hope I have left!

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:57.080
I'll use that Hayagami to make 
Akachi submit and get Homura back!

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:58.500
Now, give it to me!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.590
Move and I'll kill you!

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.300
You can kill an unarmed man?

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.930
What's wrong? Come on, kill me!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:15.090
You'd rather lose than 
hurt your opponent?

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:17.190
Pathetic boy.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:20.570
Why did Tsukuyo choose 
someone like you?

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.260
Master Arata!

00:13:27.190 --> 00:13:29.860
Lord Kannagi, please stop!

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:32.120
Kotoha!

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:34.710
Master Arata!

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:41.420
Emisu...

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:42.410
Kotoha!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:48.970
They're in trouble!

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:53.730
Don't, Master Arata!

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:55.790
There's still something you have to do!

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:58.560
Don't worry about me! Just run!

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:00.470
I promised

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:03.280
that I would protect you!

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.160
Master Arata, why?

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:24.300
Arata! Kotoha-chan!

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:32.790
<i>Kannagi...</i>

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:42.980
<i>Kannagi,</i>

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:45.280
<i>let me introduce you to the new helpers</i>

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.700
<i>who will work at the 
mansion starting today.</i>

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.950
<i>This is Akachi and Emisu.</i>

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:53.370
<i>Nice to meet you,</i>

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:55.490
<i>Akachi and Emisu.</i>

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:02.540
Arata! Kotoha-chan! Are you okay?!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.480
Kannagi!

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:08.720
Lord Kannagi!

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:22.940
Aw, man!

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.570
You've improved a lot.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:28.350
I'm an even match for you now.

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:30.490
No, I'm stronger!

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.240
Oh, is that right?

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:39.900
You've got a way to go, Young Master.

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:42.060
Man, you're pissing me off.

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:43.380
Kannagi!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.640
You have to try harder!

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:47.700
Don't get too conceited!

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:49.590
You, too, Emisu? That's harsh!

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:53.630
You have to become truly strong 
to protect those you love.

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:55.890
You do have someone 
you love, don't you?

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:00.020
Do your best for her sake, too!

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:02.100
Right...

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:16.600
Back then, if the lord 
of the domain hadn't...

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:21.620
If the previous Sho of Okoro hadn't 
died and lost his domain...

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:25.360
It's mutiny! 
The servants are revolting!

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:27.380
The master has been killed!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:30.260
The young master... 
Is the young master safe?!

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.920
Don't let the son escape!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.880
Kill anyone who sides with him!

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:36.940
Emisu!

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:38.950
Give me your hand!

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:49.360
We can ride this down to 
the ocean! We can escape!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.480
Come on, Akachi!

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.880
Go! Leave these guys to me!

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:54.990
You fool! What are you saying?! Get in!

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:59.560
That only carries two.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.620
Take care of Emisu.

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:05.750
Don't let them go!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:07.250
Go, Kannagi!

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:10.170
Akachi!

00:17:11.810 --> 00:17:13.800
Akachi!

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.510
Kannagi, go back!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:19.520
Akachi is...

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:27.650
It's no use. My power isn't enough.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:29.670
A burn, of all things?

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:32.230
And he was fine in the 
middle of those flames.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.490
I bet it's a wound he got 
before he became a Sho.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.910
Or perhaps, a wound of the heart.

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:41.970
Emisu...

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:46.710
Emisu!

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:55.130
Emisu...

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:00.240
Thank you,

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:02.990
Kannagi.

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:12.900
Emisu...

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.200
There's someone on the ground!

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:17.740
Master Ohika?

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:19.710
Let's get them to the village.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.720
"I will make Emisu happy."

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.340
That thought alone kept me going

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:27.410
when I left my homeland of Haniyasu

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:31.760
and wandered until I arrived 
here in Kagutsuchi, barely alive.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.760
Haniyasu... You came 
from that far away?

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:39.390
All the people of Kagutsuchi were kind.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:43.810
Emisu and I decided to 
live out our lives here.

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:45.560
But then...

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:53.810
It's been five days. At this rate...

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.290
I'm going to look for medicinal herbs.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:19:00.320
Emisu, the underground 
vein is active right now.

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.370
We must wait until it calms.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.750
How long will that take, Master Ohika?

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:07.120
Two days? Three days?

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:09.820
Calm down. You have to stay calm.

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:20.130
Emisu?

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:24.810
She couldn't have...

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:35.380
Emisu!

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.650
Kannagi!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:37.900
I'm coming!

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:40.120
Don't! Stay away!

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:57.670
Emisu...

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:01.860
Kannagi... Thank goodness...

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:11.140
Why?!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.410
Why? Why?

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:16.860
God of flames, why did you take Emisu?

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:19.150
I give my life to you!

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:22.320
Without Emisu, 
I have no reason to live!

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.340
Homura, god of flames!

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:27.340
Take me to Emisu's side!

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:30.290
I have heard your request.

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:36.280
Your lamentations are as flames.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:38.710
You are suitable to be my Sho.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:42.050
I am Homura!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.320
I watched Emisu die.

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:50.990
In return, I became a Sho,

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:53.690
and thus I still live today.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:57.650
To me, Homura is Emisu herself.

00:20:57.650 --> 00:21:01.350
That's why I will get it back 
from Akachi, whatever it takes.

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:07.170
Lord Akachi and Lord Kannagi 
were so close before.

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:10.430
Yet, now this has happened...

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:18.380
I wonder why...

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:24.360
Join us, Kannagi.

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:28.180
Come with me.

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:34.880
We're going to change this nation,

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:36.770
this world.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:44.740
Oh? Arata the Sho...

00:21:45.600 --> 00:21:48.700
I never imagined he'd coax 
Lord Kannagi to his side.

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:51.910
Looks like things are 
getting interesting,

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:53.780
Lord Yorunami.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:21:59.130
You're certain?

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:03.260
I see.

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:05.470
So they're on the move.

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:08.520
The Six Sho.

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:42.690
Every damn one of them...

00:23:42.690 --> 00:23:45.840
If I hadn't said that, they'd 
have made me their target, too!

00:23:45.840 --> 00:23:49.550
Why don't I jump in to 
back up Kadowaki, then?

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:51.070
Because of him...

00:23:51.010 --> 00:25:54.050
Orochi

00:23:51.070 --> 00:23:54.050
He took my place away from me!
